<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-06T21:41:17.445Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 21:41:17 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran launched a missile that struck a building in Tel Aviv and threatened to reopen the Strait of Hormuz if U.S. conditions are met, while the United States struck Iran's Qeshm Island. Iran delivered a secret Khamenei message to Putin as Moscow pushes a gas pipeline deal and a rocket launcher deal deepens Russia-Iran ties. South Korea is extending anti-piracy patrols closer to the Strait of Hormuz, and Iran reports tankers hit in the strait and a Saudi coalition intercepting a missile aimed at Medina. Iran has sent a nuclear proposal to the United States via Qatar and is reviewing concrete proposals on its nuclear program. 123 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/05/us/politics/trump-iran-war-midterm-elections.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/06/iran-delivers-secret-khamenei-message-to-putin-as-moscow-pushes-gas-pipeline-deal&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/05/world/middleeast/peace-talks-iran-united-states-qatar-nuclear-program.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/05/south-korea-plans-to-extend-anti-piracy-patrols-closer-to-strait-of-hormuz&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNeDF3QVZIQUhBWFZMbXJXaDlSVlpaeGQyNmQwZFFPNXRvaXdNU3NSQU5leno1aG9KUURCNnc2WXEzSGw5dE5hanM0djBVUTFDWDhWVldVcXhQZGpVbTBYcFUwNlREWHpMOWp3Y09NTFN2LUJMcUhCaXd4NThmTDJ3OTNGUzhLU0tDRy1KN3BXOVZheTk1MUpyangteDJaQ184aG94RXNzUHp2eHc5YkhGS05VTDhLVU90Q3hB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu